the predicates are:
    we will make *a payment* for *an incident* under *a policy*.
    *an incident* is covered.
    *a policy* is cancelled.

the knowledge base unless_test includes:
    rule one:
    we will make a payment for an incident under a policy if 
        the incident is covered and unless the policy is cancelled.

scenario test_one is:
    the payment is payment789.
    the incident is incident123.
    the policy is policy456.
    incident123 is covered.
    % policy456 is NOT cancelled

scenario test_two is:
    the payment is payment789.
    the incident is incident123.
    the policy is policy456.
    incident123 is covered.
    policy456 is cancelled.

query one is:
    we will make payment789 for incident123 under policy456.
